+        "NAE-3SAT when every variable occurs at most seven times; the shipping "
+        "distribution uses 150 variables of occurrence six or seven, and the "
+        "measured 50,000-node NAE-DPLL baseline exhausts its budget on every "
+        "reported shipping seed."
